{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e4bac464a96d5f8f27317a256848385c4c70fd1ba44bda684585ab5ac4f3b76", "ja": "ここが今夜、私のステージに……。\n話には聞いていましたが、本当にスキー場なんですね。", "zh": "这里就是我今晚的舞台……\n虽然有事先听说，但没想到舞台真的是滑雪场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1001_p", "source_sha256": "62cd39babebc0fea97f51223b2b9fdacc1f394d860aba71eea2ab44c10e1cc7c", "ja": "ああ、夜はゲレンデの一部がフロアになるそうだ。\nま、広さは十分かな。", "zh": "是啊，到了晚上，部分雪场会变成观众席的样子。\n总之，场地是绝对够大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "86ae1b21872bb22f98dc6d84eb399f04c70123ffe30e7047101dae9b29dda2f9", "ja": "はい。音は少し散ってしまいそうですが……\n野外の会場は、そういうものかと。", "zh": "嗯，虽然感觉声音会不太集中……\n但野外的会场应该都是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "de3c4e6d1b0d7c8b92fa7601a2e2654a2fa90ad61218e9c6c6e13882d2c839c3", "ja": "むしろ、寒さと乾燥が問題になりそうです。\nノドのケアも、しっかりしておかないと。", "zh": "我更担心的是，寒冷与干燥的问题。\n我自己也得好好保养喉咙才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5938bb99166de8999e88da7de1551b77a1660e25aea39688211d93d0bc089ef8", "ja": "よし、控え室はしっかり暖めておこう。\n予備のジャケットとホットドリンクも用意するよ。", "zh": "好，我会事先让准备室温暖起来的。\n也会准备好备用的外套和热饮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "06703e15c9c1005ef9f0862ba3289e5b8d3ff4b2c56eaeb373438cf0609209c9", "ja": "あの、{$P$}？　私はともかく、\n観客の皆さんは、開場を待つ間、どこに……？", "zh": "请问，{$P$}，先不说我，\n开场之前，观众要在哪里等候……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6af8fbbd95a0cdccf84f0c898fcb85acd9fa50e29d05e2c1c73effce34d8c29", "ja": "大丈夫。グッズ販売用に近くのロッジを借り切ってて、\nそこが広い待合室になってるんだ。", "zh": "这你不用担心，我已经包下附近的小木屋\n来贩卖周边商品，那里同时也是宽敞的等候室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "36adc5766931209c77c161b4baa5b0537c663bce53a88d0d1d4de8ba4553c509", "ja": "なら、暖かいですね……安心しました。皆さんに\n風邪をひかせてしまっては、歌以前の問題ですから。", "zh": "那应该会很温暖……这样我就放心了。\n要是害大家感冒，那我唱歌就没意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a38925944b1c63defd5c584e7a12c547da5c03cc951ab72efec94f174a817078", "ja": "まあでも、ここはスキー場だからな。意外とみんな、\n楽しく滑りながら待ってそうだけどな。", "zh": "不过，这里毕竟是滑雪场。\n说不定大家会一边享受滑雪一边等呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "786b3f63ce15be7b5e0b151e2cbe3f55ec68fd5875e3e15bb948f00e4700c320", "ja": "楽しく過ごしてもらえるなら、それが一番です。\n体も暖まりそうですし。", "zh": "观众可以开心度过等候时间的话，那就再好不过了。\n而且感觉身体也会暖和起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f65a9635d5522a577ddd2388f65f25812685b27fdc460e14015a264ae1b125d2", "ja": "千早はいいのか？", "zh": "千早不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "fe665c14a11a9d56ce56b9da79a4e76da9ed25b506089a232fe40f61f5471aa6", "ja": "え？　何がですか？", "zh": "咦？去什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5396eaaf8964dc3f61a15b9952dbcffde6304335f92e07f6f939b8c3712b0662", "ja": "スキーだよ。折角来たんだし、すべってみたらどうだ？\n時間もまだたっぷりあるし。", "zh": "滑雪啊。难得来到这边，去滑个雪怎么样？\n反正还有很多时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "cf0244f35049ab0c303337430fe6a55a32917403a6d1377760cf600285a0250e", "ja": "……はあ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1a9883aa6776b06460dc5c447d1a53efd72fb75704c184f929426ab63cce446e", "ja": "すごく気のない返事だな……。\nほら、向こうで滑ってる人たち、楽しそうだろ？", "zh": "这回应听来非常不感兴趣哪……\n你瞧，在那边滑雪的人，看起来都很快乐不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "891d5aac3a9c924a81748836a041dd8b8a8fa5fbe073fbe385aa1ab48213a861", "ja": "ですが、私は遊びに来たわけでは……。\nあ、でも、体力作りにはなるのかしら。", "zh": "但我又不是来玩的……\n啊，不过，滑雪是不是有助于增强体力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "7193f3c6811dee4f4008c2078ba75cbf6e4f68875010264f053595eface98cab", "ja": "スキーでの滑走。やや前傾気味で姿勢を固定して。\n体幹を意識して、バランスをとって……。", "zh": "在滑行时，身体要保持稍微前倾的姿势，\n也得注意撑住体干以维持平衡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dacf7df4d112f4a23dde7311417e55d15040a287f9c41fe18905a84d1ec4cd3e", "ja": "千早？", "zh": "千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "cb7d9f766cbd303e7851bf2f820cf1542c1c0fd4fdba0ef45c27d26de720c30a", "ja": "あ、いえ……では少しだけ。{$P$}、\nスキーのご指導、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "啊，没事……那我就滑一下吧。\n{$P$}，麻烦你指导我滑雪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1021_null", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "92a5b8b730f0bd51bc85d9478de006634b845d32253aa8ca4264f3295a8d276e", "ja": "ひざは柔らかく……\n重心は、少し前に……。", "zh": "膝盖放松……\n重心稍微往前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1023_p", "source_sha256": "606467883f5be4a96b7d7fba53336447562967ce07c4985806941e51d708a9f4", "ja": "千早、そろそろ衣装に着替えて……千早？", "zh": "千早，差不多该换上表演服装了……千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "11eb6b3397e8e5cc7a5327f9f410c2425c2c4894d6eb9608bd2f70b7a2765694", "ja": "あっ。す、すみません！\nついイメージトレーニング……あ、いえ。", "zh": "啊，抱、抱歉！\n不小心做起了想像训练……啊，没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "f4f3c8a13309624d67a9c2f4743bf2b972fa1a54cc002bc708611273c5c043f2", "ja": "その、わかっています。\n私は、遊びに来たわけではありませんから。", "zh": "那个，我知道的。\n毕竟我不是为了游乐而来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "7c00f77d38e0e90c799104a08d2f09865aea0a8338bfe833d70d3b4bb1a38840", "ja": "あの白銀のゲレンデに私が刻むのは、\nシュプールではなく、旋律……！", "zh": "我要在那片银白雪场上刻下的\n不是滑雪的痕迹，而是旋律……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0093_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7275042065141dbb05f2b860ff70355e38a3a3d09f7d399c891a3ce599d310e2", "ja": "（千早には思った以上に、新鮮な経験になったらしい。\n…次に来るときは、スキーだけを目的にしないとな！）", "zh": "（这次演出对千早来说，似乎成了超乎想像的新鲜体验。\n……下次来的时候，该让她专程来滑雪才是！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
